''[[General:Behind the Wall: The Making of Skyrim|Behind the Wall: The Making of Skyrim]]'' is a promotional documentary released with the Skyrim Collector's Edition in 2011. It features many behind the scenes insights.<noinclude>

<includeonly>For more information, see the [[General:Behind the Wall: The Making of Skyrim|main article]].</includeonly>

